[ceiling] This is the annular head seat where a 10.6 mm bolt well reduces to its 5.4 mm screw passage. Its radial overhang is 2.6 mm, rather than a solid 10.6 mm unsupported disc. Bridge the shoulder, keep support out of the screw tunnel, and inspect flat head seating through the open rear well.
